# Computational Code and Input Files

This directory documents the computational workflow used in the brushite–banana-peel biocomposite adsorption project.

## Software and Workflow

- **Avogadro:** Molecular structure construction and inspection.
- **xTB:** Preliminary geometry optimization and vibrational frequency calculations.
- **ORCA:** Density functional theory calculations and electronic-structure analysis.
- **VESTA:** Visualization of HOMO–LUMO distributions and molecular electrostatic potential maps.
- **BIOVIA Discovery Studio:** Geometrical visualization of molecular structures and adsorption complexes.

## Planned Contents

- xTB input files and execution commands
- ORCA input files (`.inp`)
- Calculation output files and relevant extracted results
- Scripts for analyzing energies and organizing results
- Documentation of visualization procedures

Only verified input files, commands, and scripts from the actual calculations will be included. Computational settings will be documented from the original files rather than reconstructed from memory.
